# Never copy host build state into image build contexts (correctness + speed).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/*.log
.DS_Store

# Secrets — keep credentials out of the build context / image layers (mirrors .gitignore).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.kubeconfig
**/kubeconfig
